# Privacy Policy for {app_name}

**Effective date: 1 January 2026**

{app_name} is designed to keep its core experience on your device. This policy explains how information is handled by {developer_entity}.

## The short version

{app_name} does not require an account for its core experience. Information you enter into the app remains on your device unless a feature clearly tells you otherwise before you use it.

## Information stored on your device

The app may save preferences and content you create in local device storage so that your experience can continue between sessions. You can remove that local information by clearing the app's data or deleting the app, subject to any independent device backups.

## Information we do not collect

The core app does not include advertising networks, behavioral profiling, or third-party marketing trackers. {developer_entity} cannot see content that remains only on your device.

## Device permissions

The app does not require location, contacts, microphone, or camera access for its core experience. If a future feature needs an additional permission, your device will ask before granting it.

## Children

{app_name} is intended for a general audience and is not directed to children below the age at which parental consent is required in their region. The core app does not knowingly collect personal information from children.

## Changes to this policy

If the app's data practices change, this policy will be updated before the relevant feature is released. The effective date at the top will remain the fixed version date for this generated launch kit.

